WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:03.570
- You've also said that The Matrix

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:08.010
may be one of your more
favorite AI-related movies.

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:09.910
Can you elaborate why?

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:12.140
- Yeah, it is one of my favorite movies.

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:15.500
And it's because it represents

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.380
kind of all the things I think about.

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:20.400
So there's a symbiotic relationship

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.430
between robots and humans, right?

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:26.810
That symbiotic relationship
is that they don't destroy us,

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:28.910
they enslave us, right?

00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:29.893
But think about it.

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:34.590
Even though they enslaved us,

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:36.980
they needed us to be happy, right?

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:38.840
And in order to be
happy, they had to create

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:41.130
this gritty world that they
then had to live in, right?

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:43.224
That's the whole thing or premise.

00:00:43.224 --> 00:00:48.224
But then, there were humans
that had a choice, right?

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:49.925
Like you had a choice to stay

00:00:49.925 --> 00:00:53.140
in this horrific, horrific world

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:56.880
where it was your fantasy's
life with all of the anomalies,

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:59.060
perfection but not accurate.

00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:02.250
Or you can choose to be on your own

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:06.790
and like have maybe no
food for a couple of days,

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:09.410
but you were totally autonomous.

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:12.290
And so I think of that, and that's why.

00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:13.990
So it's necessarily us being enslaved,

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:17.350
but I think about us having
this symbiotic relationship,

00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:20.080
robots and AI, even if
they become sentient,

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:21.420
they're still part of our society

00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:23.627
and they will suffer just as much as we.

00:01:23.627 --> 00:01:25.006
- Just as us.

00:01:25.006 --> 00:01:28.110
And there will be some kind of equilibrium

00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:29.130
that we'll have to find,

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:31.040
some symbiotic relationship.

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:32.530
- Right, and then you have the ethicists,

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:36.590
the robotics folks, that are
like, no this has got to stop.

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:39.993
I will take the other pill in
order to make a difference.

